<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 1in">“<u>Clearing Corporation
Security</u>” means securities which are in the custody of or maintained on the books of a Clearing Corporation or a nominee subject
