by the Borrower to the Collateral Agent under the Facility Documents, in connection with the transactions contemplated by this Agreement.</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 1in">“<u>Collateral Loan</u>”
