<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 1in">“<u>Collateral Loan Buy
Confirmation</u>” means with respect to any Collateral Loan acquired from a third party, documentation evidencing, in reasonable
detail, the related Loan Party’s acquisition of such Collateral Loan, and which shall identify at least the obligor, price and
