Date immediately preceding the first Payment Date and (b)&nbsp;with respect to any subsequent Payment Date, the period from but excluding
the Determination Date immediately preceding the previous Payment Date to and including the Determination Date immediately preceding
the current Payment Date; <u>provided</u> that the final Collection Period hereunder shall end on and include the day prior to the payment
in full of the Advances hereunder.</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</p>

