<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 1in">In addition, the Servicer on
behalf of the Borrower will obtain any and all consents required by the Related Documents relating to any Instruments, accounts or general
