<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 1in">Notwithstanding the foregoing,
the Loan Value of a Delayed Reporting Obligation shall not be amended by the Administrative Agent (other than at the request of the Borrower)
