<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 1in">“<u>Minimum Equity Amount</u>”
means, at any time, the Aggregate Principal Balance of the Eligible Collateral Loans for the three largest Obligors.</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 1in">“<u>Minimum Floating Spread</u>”
