<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 1in">“<u>Other Connection Taxes</u>”
means, in the case of any Secured Party, any Taxes imposed as a result of a present or former connection between such Secured Party and
the jurisdiction imposing such Tax (other than connections arising from such Secured Party having executed, delivered, become a party
to, performed obligations under, received payments under, received or perfected a security interest under, engaged in any other transaction
pursuant to or enforced this Agreement, the Notes or any other Facility Document).</p>

