<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 1in">“<u>S&amp;P</u>”
means S&amp;P Global Ratings, a Standard&nbsp;&amp; Poor’s Financial Services, LLC business, together with its successors.</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 1in">“<u>S&amp;P Industry Classification</u>”
