applicable Loan Party intends to purchase with the proceeds of the Advance must be on the current Approved List; <u>provided</u> that,
in each case, such approval has not expired, been withdrawn, been deemed to be rejected or been rescinded in accordance with Section&nbsp;2.02.</font></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 1.25in"><font style="font-size: 10pt">(b)</font>&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;<font style="font-size: 10pt">the
