<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 1.25in"><font style="font-size: 10pt">(c)</font>&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;<font style="font-size: 10pt">immediately
after the making of such Advance on the applicable Borrowing Date, the Minimum OC Coverage Test shall be satisfied (as demonstrated on
the Borrowing Base Calculation Statement attached to such Notice of Borrowing);</font></p>

