<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 1.25in"><font style="font-size: 10pt">(i)</font>&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;<font style="font-size: 10pt"><u>Sanctions</u>.
None of the Equityholder, its subsidiaries, their respective directors or officers, or, to the best knowledge of the Equityholder, their
