with its and such Person’s officers, partners, employees and accountants; provided that so long as no Event of Default has occurred
the Borrower shall be responsible for all costs and expenses for only one such visit per fiscal year by the Lenders and the Administrative
Agent. The Administrative Agent shall be permitted to schedule such visits on behalf of the Lenders and shall (1)&nbsp;coordinate in
