of any such party to comply with the terms of this Agreement, and shall have no liability for any inaccuracy or error in the performance
or observance on the Collateral Agent’s part of any of its duties hereunder that is caused by or results from any such inaccurate,
incomplete or untimely information received by it, or other failure on the part of any such other party to comply with the terms hereof.</font></p>

