cases the Collateral Agent shall be acting, giving, withholding, suffering, omitting, making or otherwise undertaking and exercising the
same (or shall not be undertaking and exercising the same) solely as directed in writing by the Administrative Agent acting at the instruction
of the Required Lenders (or such other Lenders or percentage thereof as shall be expressly required hereunder). The Collateral Agent may
