solely as a result thereof until it shall have received such instructions from the Administrative Agent acting at the direction of such
Lenders. The Collateral Agent shall not have any liability for any failure or delay in taking any actions contemplated above as a result
of a failure or delay on the part of the requisite Lenders (or the Administrative Agent on their behalf) to provide such instruction.</font></p>

