(x)&nbsp;a certificate to the effect that such Foreign Lender is not a “bank” within the meaning of Section&nbsp;881(c)(3)(A)&nbsp;of
the Code, a “10 percent shareholder” of the Borrower (or its sole owner, as applicable) within the meaning of Section&nbsp;881(c)(3)(B)&nbsp;of
the Code, or a “controlled foreign corporation” related to the Borrower (or its sole owner, as applicable) as described in
Section&nbsp;881(c)(3)(C)&nbsp;of the Code (a “<u>U.S. Tax Compliance Certificate</u>”) and (y)&nbsp;executed copies of U.S.
Internal Revenue Service Form&nbsp;W-8BEN-E (or W-8BEN, as applicable); or</font></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 1in; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in"><font style="font-size: 10pt">(D)</font>&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;<font style="font-size: 10pt">to
