(i)&nbsp;would eliminate or reduce amounts payable pursuant to this Section&nbsp;13.03 in the future and (ii)&nbsp;would not subject such
Lender to any unreimbursed cost or expense and would not otherwise be disadvantageous to such Lender. The Borrower hereby agrees to pay
all reasonable costs and expenses incurred by any Lender in connection with any such designation or assignment.</font></p>

