<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 1in"><font style="font-size: 10pt">(i)</font>&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;<font style="font-size: 10pt">Each
party’s obligations under this Section&nbsp;13.03 shall survive the resignation or replacement of an Agent or any assignment of
rights by, or the replacement of, a Lender, the termination of the Individual Lender Maximum Funding Amounts and the repayment, satisfaction
